This project audits an engagement: of the deliverables a statement of work says
should exist, which are moving, which are tracked and stalled, and which are
absent. The first two are different answers and a tracker that reports only
"open" cannot tell them apart.

NO REDISTRIBUTED THIRD-PARTY CONTENT

Nothing in this repository was copied from anywhere else. No statement of work,
engagement, client or consultant named anywhere here is real, and every example
will say so on its face.

